# The final event (digital 10 HIGH) arrives after the child wake-up plus a
# 10 ms inlined sleep. In this host clock each millis() call advances 1 tick, so
# the current scheduler reaches it in pass 39. The range keeps a generous
# margin below and above that value: too low means a wait was skipped, too high
# means wake-up stopped being prompt.
min 10
max 60
